# Renderer UI & Components

## Styling

- Tailwind CSS with shadcn/ui components. Dark industrial theme: dark backgrounds, high contrast, DS-Digital font for weight displays.

## Organization

- Reusable components in `src/components/`; routes/pages in `src/routes/`. Dialogs (e.g. new weight) may live in `components/`.

## State & forms

- Zustand for global state: `useWeightStore`, `useSettingsStore`, `useWeightDialogsStore`.
- Forms use React Hook Form + Zod. Multi-step forms follow the SetupWizard pattern: a single form instance, per-step validation, stepper with transitions.

## Data fetching & feedback

- Fetch through preload API methods (`window.electronAPI.getAllVehicles()`, etc.) inside effects; handle loading and error states with toasts (`toast.error()`).
- React to serial status changes in the UI (traffic-light indicator, "NO SIGNAL" display) as the serial manager emits `disconnected`, `reconnecting`, etc.

## Portals & popovers

In Electron, shadcn popovers/dropdowns may misbehave inside dialogs. Use `portalled={false}` on `PopoverContent` within dialogs, or set a custom container to the dialog's content element.

```tsx
<PopoverContent portalled={false}>...</PopoverContent>
```
